sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant S as Resource Server
    participant F as Facilitator
    participant L as Solana
    C->>S: GET /resource
    S-->>C: 402 + PAYMENT-REQUIRED (accepts: scheme, network, asset, amount, payTo)
    Note over C: Ký transaction transferChecked<br/>(chưa gửi lên chain)
    C->>S: GET /resource + PAYMENT-SIGNATURE (PaymentPayload)
    S->>S: accepted khớp option đã công bố? payload chưa dùng?
    S->>F: POST /verify
    F-->>S: isValid
    S->>F: POST /settle
    F->>L: Submit transaction (facilitator là fee payer)
    L-->>F: Confirmed signature
    F-->>S: success + transaction
    S-->>C: 200 + PAYMENT-RESPONSE + nội dung
